Does a lot of this stuff.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:13.500
Over the years I've gone from wanting products

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.500
 

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:16.500
To wanting experiences

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.000
To wanting impact.

