And so, when I was younger I wanted stuff.  I wanted toys.  Right.  I wanted new shoes or new computer

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:25.500
Or new clothes.  Whatever it was.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.000
As I got older it became less and less important

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.500
One, I can go out and get whatever I needed and I would just buy it

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:31.500
if I wanted it.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:34.500
There was nothing on my list that "I wish I could go and buy this thing."

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.500
Two, I've been getting rid of stuff.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:38.500
Like I have two much stuff

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:40.000
People are sending me stuff

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.500
It's a good problem to have I guess.  But I want to pair down.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.500
I don't need as much stuff anymore to be happy.

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:46.500
So I don't want people to send me

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:48.500
"stuff" as a birthday present.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:52.000
I moved to experiences.  And experiences is like

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.500
Let's go enjoy a baseball game together.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:56.000
Or on a vacation.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.500
Or let's learn how to snowboard.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.500
Give me a certificate for the winter.  We'll go snowboarding.

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:02.500
And I still like that stuff.  I still appreciate it.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:04.500
Still like it more than products.

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:06.500
Again, like if I wanted to go do something I could go do it.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:13.500
I don't like being away from Toronto for too long.  There's too much important stuff I'm doing here.

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:15.500
There's no new experience I am dying to try out

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:17.000
 

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:19.500
If I was, I would just go out and do it.

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:21.500
Well what I am moving more and more towards is impact.

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:23.500
Like the thing that gets me excited

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:25.000
is knowing that I am helping somebody

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:29.500
Like, I am having a meaning impact in their life somehow

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:34.500
So earlier this week Alex asked me "What can I get you for your birthday?"

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:36.500
It's coming up.  Tell me what you want. I'm a guy

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:38.500
You're a guy.  You don't have to beat around the bush.  Just tell me what you want.

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:40.500
I'll go out and buy it.

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.500
I said "Alex.  I don't need anything.  Don't buy me anything.  The biggest thing you could do is

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:46.500
Do something that's on your bucket list.

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:49.500
Do something that you're afraid of.

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:50.500
Or just been putting off for too long.

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:52.500
Go out and do that

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:54.500
and let me birthday be the excuse

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:56.500
for you to go out and do it

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:58.500
So he's been looking into skydiving.

00:01:58.500 --> 00:01:59.500
Evan talking to Alex: "Did you book it?"

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:00.500
Alex:  Ye!  I did book it

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:02.500
Evan to Alex: Tandem right?  You're going to be strapped.

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:04.500
 

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:08.500
So the biggest thing you guys could get me.  If you are looking to do something.

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:10.500
Is I would love for you too, look at your list.

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:12.500
Of things that you really want to do.

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:14.500
Something that's on your bucket list.

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:16.000
Something that you are afraid of doing.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:17.000
And just do it!

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:19.500
Let this be the excuse to actually go out and do it

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:22.500
Don't wait five years for it to happen

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:25.500
Take one thing, cross it off and do it.

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:26.500
 

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:28.500
And tell me what it is.

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:30.500
Even if you haven't done it yet.

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:32.500
Take an action to plan to do it.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:34.000
Leave it in the comments below.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:36.500
That would really make

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:38.500
my birthday super special

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:40.500
Please, please, please, take action!

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:42.500
I want to have some impact beyond what I am already doing

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:44.500
So thank you guys so much.  You have been an insane

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:46.500
source of

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:48.500
joy for the past year

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:50.500
I'm looking forward to another

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:54.500
10, 20, 30, 40, 50 years of doing this!

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:56.500
Continue to BELIEVE!

00:02:56.500 --> 00:03:00.500
And I'll see you soon!

